  <item>
    <title>34. 如何走路？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6999f01bde29766da919c32c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6999f01bde29766da919c32c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Feb 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a> </span></strong><span>为什么我们对"走路"这件事如此执着?</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a></span></strong><span> 低头族如何影响行路安全与他人体验?</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a></span></strong><span> 走路是社会关系的缩影：个人意识、城市规则与公共空间的交互</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></strong><span> 春运文化背景下的人流：为什么在中国personal space难以存在</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a></span></strong><span> 过程 vs 目的：中国人更在意终点而非旅途本身</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a></span></strong><span> 七七的走路困扰：重心不稳、单脚内八与脊椎侧弯的关联</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a></span></strong><span> 正确走路的物理讲解：重心转移、脚掌发力与"蹬"的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a></span></strong><span> Rol的走路习惯：喜欢无目的的城市漫步与街头摄影</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a></span></strong><span> 为什么上海是适合走路的城市：街道尺度与安全感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a></span></strong><span> 童年仪态教育：被父母纠正走姿如何影响性格形成</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a></span></strong><span> 不同文化下的松弛感：中日欧美的仪态与情绪表达差异</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">19:49</a></span></strong><span> 两人一起走路的习惯差异：依赖感 vs 独立决策</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a></span></strong><span> 意识涣散的代价：在家刷手机与在外走路的精神状态类比</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a></span></strong><span> 犹豫 vs 彷徨：可以不确定，但不能不做决定的走路哲学</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a></span></strong><span> 公民意识的体现：撑伞让行、避让他人等微小行为背后的公共精神</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Rol写的关于“走路”的文字：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DpFU8zJe27ZLro8zq_yBuQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DpFU8zJe27ZLro8zq_yBuQ"><span>伞（组诗）</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ig_TNX_T07mc5NV4YUx-hw?token=150671537&amp;lang=zh_CN" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ig_TNX_T07mc5NV4YUx-hw?token=150671537&amp;lang=zh_CN"><span>走路与写作</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GT9Vi7FEHHa9sGoLL9qGTA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GT9Vi7FEHHa9sGoLL9qGTA"><span>走路的艺术</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2Rt_5glPrgFuk19xYk5dpA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2Rt_5glPrgFuk19xYk5dpA"><span>低头的逻辑</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>BGM</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Bell Tower by </span><em><span>Mama Aiuto</span></em></p>]]></description>
