  <item>
    <title>31. 审美可以被“教”出来吗？美育、品味与不确定性</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691014c6af4fc00da7d1e4ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691014c6af4fc00da7d1e4ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Nov 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 自媒体账号“城市审丑漫游”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> “广告”、“宣传”、“标识”与审美的分离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 公共建设的制式化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 为什么绿色能源就一定用绿色标明？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> “5A景区”的建设逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 美育就等于艺术教育吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a> 美可以被量化吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> “削苹果”的故事与东亚社会的特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> “狭义”美育与“广义”美育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 什么是“学术品味”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> “直觉”与“真诚”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> 从生活中的选择到量子力学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a> 美的“不确定性”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 审美可以被“教”出来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 美的核心是关于美的意识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 个人的美学叙事与社会发展的方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a> 当代社会对于追求美的“耻感”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> “赛道思维”与“真诚兴趣”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 每个人在生活中有不同的“优先级”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a> “体验”与“符号”——消费主义与美的关系</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“美育”（"aesthetic education"）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>美育，又称美感教育。即通过培养人们认识美、体验美、感受美、欣赏美和创造美的能力，从而使我们具有美的理想、美的情操、美的品格和美的素养。狭义的美育通常指“艺术教育”，专注于教育活动的形式与具体内容；广义的美育是指将美学原则渗透于各科教学后形成的教育，更注重美的精神实质，比如人生的美学趣味和审美境界。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>BGM</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>What Was Before by Leavv</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/654c8b2b29def419f2e828da/lrKIWYpy6f-gNxwzl_KKlPXHnDtH.m4a" length="43990421" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhDvGg5J49m0vfLa9FfoGYKjIHQQ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>31</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>30. 经济下行是社会人文的契机吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68deb0ff8e321a0d6fbc37a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68deb0ff8e321a0d6fbc37a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Oct 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 明天一定会更好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a> “康波曲线”——社会发展的周期性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 时代的“红利”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> “投机”与“赛道”的思维</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 新能源电车行业的另一面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 房地产暴利时代的建筑设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> 失去的话语权与多样性——经济下行时期的自媒体行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 日本在“失去的三十年”里有所收获吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> “小确幸”里的个体独立性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> “变慢”的时代会让我们更多地审视自己吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> 社会文化的走向与时代的“岔路口”</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“康波曲线”（“康波周期”）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>也被称为康德拉季耶夫周期，是一种经济周期理论，其特点是一个完整的周期大约持续50到60年。这个理论是由俄国经济学家尼古拉·康德拉季耶夫在1925年提出的，基于对英、法、美、德等主要工业化国家的历史经济数据进行分析而得出的。康波周期理论认为经济发展存在明显的周期性，每个周期都会经历回升、繁荣、衰退和萧条四个阶段。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>BGM</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>Barcade</span></em><span> by </span><em><span>Ian Ewing &amp; Philanthrope</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/654c8b2b29def419f2e828da/lp_qfc_yBCeN0xZjH5u6ehy7v5QQ.m4a" length="30460673" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhDvGg5J49m0vfLa9FfoGYKjIHQQ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>30</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>29. “写作”比“读书”重要吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689b82d7032793b18a16fbfd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689b82d7032793b18a16fbfd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> “写作”是一个严肃的词吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 一种梳理自我的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> reading, learning, studying...——“读书”指的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 兴趣？形式？心理安慰？——不同人生阶段的“读书”行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 视频可以替代书本吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 被“切片”的视频、文字、观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 书的商品属性与新媒体运营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 不是所有的书都值得看——“读书”是一种消费行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> “轻观点、重叙述”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1451">24:11</a> 退化了的写作能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 写作中的逻辑性训练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 写作是一件真诚的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> “输出”比“输入”更重要！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>BGM</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>How Insensitive by Antonio Adolfo</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/654c8b2b29def419f2e828da/ltHj3q6HyoNydbPhMS9hbE6zXbga.m4a" length="40958926" type="audio/mp4"/>
