  <item>
    <title>28. 男性要阳刚、女性要温柔吗？——性别美学与女性主义</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68850c65a9dec92500502b09</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68850c65a9dec92500502b09</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Jul 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 对于女性这个“身份”，你会敏感吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> “强势”对于女性是个贬义词吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 标签化的语言：被误解的“女权”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 我们都无法逃出的现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a> 关于“女性主义”的论述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 性别的“坐标系”——男性真的能感同身受吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 我国社会对于性别的观念变了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 中性气质的艺术张力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 小时候的性别意识与恋爱观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a> 社会需要一个既定的性别“坐标系”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> “情绪化”的女性更有魅力吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1577">26:17</a> “性自由”还是“性剥削”？——女性主义的不同视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1642">27:22</a> “平等”是那个最终的答案吗？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>上野千鹤子，日本著名社会学家，女性学、性别研究领域的引领者，本节目提到的其相关代表作有：《始于极限：女性主义往复书简》，《厌女：日本的女性嫌恶》，《从零开始的女性主义》。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>BGM</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Newlife by Flandrs</span></p>]]></description>
