  <item>
    <title>27. 为什么我们不爱排队？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685d266908d8fd85862238cf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685d266908d8fd85862238cf</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Jun 2025 11:01:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 排队只跟个人素质相关吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 千奇百怪的“插队”行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> “中国式”的排队“生态”——“危机感”与模糊的共识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 开车时的“个人权利”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> “集体主义”与“宗族主义”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 中国人不尊重“personal space”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">14:27</a> 有人插队的时候，你会指出来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 公民社会的“最大公约数”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> “边界感”的权衡——“个人权利”vs“集体的利益”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 公民社会的意识、规则与风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 走路时，你能感受到路人的存在吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 走路时，你能感受到自己的存在吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a> “走路”与“写作”——体现个人意识的两件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 中西方不同历史文化下产出的不同“意识”</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“公民社会”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>公民社会或市民社会（Civil Society）是指围绕共同的利益、目的和价值上的非强制性的行为集体。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“公民意识”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>指公民个人对自己在国家中地位的自我认识。具体体现为视自己和他人为拥有自由权利、有尊严、有价值的人，勇于维护自己和他人的自由权利、尊严和价值的意识，这种意识还包含公民对于国家和社会的责任感。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>BGM</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>apple tree</span></strong><span> by </span><em><span>Solar Trees</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/654c8b2b29def419f2e828da/ljllJyUAKEwI0C347u_nSq2mY4iJ.m4a" length="34897033" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhDvGg5J49m0vfLa9FfoGYKjIHQQ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>27</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>26. 说一个人很“文艺”，我们指的是什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68222df2b7c8a9962cc2c1e6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68222df2b7c8a9962cc2c1e6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 May 2025 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>Timeline</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> “文艺”这个词的听感怎么样？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 物质给人的幻觉</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 不同时代背景下的不同理解</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> “小资”生活“文艺”吗？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> “消费主义”就不能“文艺”了吗？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> “主体性”——独立的思考、真实的感受</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 自由与抗争——“文艺”的过去与今天</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 从理想主义到商业化</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 独立音乐与“小众”文化</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 文艺标签里的鄙视链</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> “装”、“做作”、“矫情”与青春</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> “叙述”与有关美的表达</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> “诗人”是一种属性</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> “文青”是个贬义词吗？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1423">23:43</a> 美的“负面”属性</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a> 如果“消极”很文艺，我们能主动拥抱它吗？</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>BGM</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Crimewave by </span><em><span>Crystal Castles</span></em></p>]]></description>
